Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Piecewise Fracture Envelope and Yield Surface (paper Figures 2 and 3)\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"558d7ff8-5aa3-44e7-8810-e6fddd02a6ee"],

Cell["\<\
Debug version: every step is its own cell with NO trailing semicolon, so \
evaluating cell-by-cell (Shift+Enter down the notebook) shows every \
intermediate value. If something is wrong, the first cell that prints an \
unexpected value (or an error) tells us exactly where. Once this works, we \
can put it back together into fewer cells.

Evaluate from the top, one cell at a time, and check each Out[] looks sane \
before moving to the next.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d7a8744e-e72a-4243-9333-d6602f45fb8c"],

